<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: ALL BIDS IN CZECH C.BANK 1-WK REPO TAKEN AT 75 PCT.</title>
<headline>ALL BIDS IN CZECH C.BANK 1-WK REPO TAKEN AT 75 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said it had accepted all bids at its second one-week repo tender on Thursday at the limit yield of 75 percent.</p>
<p>The yield in the other CNB tender held earlier in the day also reached the limit of 75 percent, after 56.63 percent in a similar tender held on Wedensday.</p>
</text>
